OL,3,AMan dies after being hit by ambulance
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has died after being struck by an
OL,6,Fambulance transporting a patient near
OL,7,FSunderland, police have said.
OL,9,FNorthumbria Police said the crash
OL,10,Foccurred on the A19, between the
OL,11,Fjunctions for the A1018 and A690,
OL,12,Fshortly after 02:00 GMT.
OL,14,FThe ambulance was travelling on the
OL,15,Fnorthbound carriageway and did not have
OL,16,Fits blue lights on when it hit the man,
OL,17,Fwho was in his 30s and died at the
OL,18,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
